{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">旅遊節目《自然系女子旅行3》第二集節目中，元老級主持林映暉（暉哥）聯同「自然系」新主持梁超怡（Joey）前往韓國濟州島東部、素有「島中島」之稱的牛島。牛島以著名的「牛島八景」著稱，二人今次行程豐富，除了品嚐甘口濃郁的野生鮑魚粥，更乘坐快艇深入海蝕洞欣賞大自然奇觀！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>交通指南：乘船出發 體驗甲板餵海鷗</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">前往牛島需在城山浦港綜合客運碼頭乘船，船班大約每30分鐘一班，船程僅需10至15分鐘。牛島設有天津港與下牛木洞港兩個客運碼頭，無論在哪一個碼頭登岸，票價均相同。購買前往牛島的船票前，必須帶備護照並填妥登船申請表。航行途中，空中會有大量海鷗盤旋，遊客可以購買「蝦條」在甲板上體驗餵海鷗的樂趣。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"31a9ad1d-a395-4cf6-bb2f-a6ab5d9b197b.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/20266b7n73UrJo1785315082.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"31a9ad1d-a395-4cf6-bb2f-a6ab5d9b197b.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"699bb219-8ad0-4d3a-9032-7d38f87edaac.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026eR1RQz024F1785315083.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"699bb219-8ad0-4d3a-9032-7d38f87edaac.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><strong>環島遊推介：租用有蓋雙人電動三輪車</strong></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>牛島面積適中，旅客可租用「有蓋雙人電動三輪車」輕鬆環島遊。租金只需百多港元便能玩足一天，一輛車可容納兩人，並有多種顏色選擇，性價比極高。由於車內未配備安全帶，駕駛者及乘客必須戴妥頭盔；新手駕駛時亦建議放慢車速，以應付部分較為顛簸的路段。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"902ecc17-f434-475f-9019-6b2c80b85226.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026cQbxTTXBQX1785315083.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"902ecc17-f434-475f-9019-6b2c80b85226.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><strong>夢幻打卡點：西濱白沙海灘尋「爆谷沙」</strong></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>身為「牛島八景」之一的西濱白沙海灘位於牛島西側，海水清澈見底，呈現由淺藍到深藍的漸層色彩。這裡的沙灘並非一般細沙，而是由表面潔白、形狀宛如「爆米花」的紅藻石組成，極具特色。西濱白沙海灘的紅藻石極具生態價值，絕對禁止帶走。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f123e1d8-6c67-4f97-a6f6-044231918bb6.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026bc4ICHnKU61785315083.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f123e1d8-6c67-4f97-a6f6-044231918bb6.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"19848b8f-f1c3-4818-84a6-6a3c5a89cc7a.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026H7XK7GvLnZ1785315083.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"19848b8f-f1c3-4818-84a6-6a3c5a89cc7a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>刺激大冒險：乘快艇探索「晝間明月」</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>想近距離欣賞奇岩怪石，可參與約30分鐘的飛揚島快艇大冒險。穿上救生衣後，快艇會傾斜衝刺，帶來十足刺激感。沿途可觀賞栩栩如生的「大象岩」以及同為牛島八景之一、由火山熔岩形成的「後海石壁」。最令人期待的是駛入海蝕洞內，欣賞上午10至11時限定的「晝間明月」奇觀——陽光反射到洞穴天花板，猶如一輪皎潔滿月。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"01c96568-31c9-4c94-a9bf-970205d937ab.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026GkNf5aNDFS1785315083.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"01c96568-31c9-4c94-a9bf-970205d937ab.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"355261bb-1d2d-4601-88f1-1f30318c6e66.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026JOVVDovvFK1785315083.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"355261bb-1d2d-4601-88f1-1f30318c6e66.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7a1aed1b-cf59-4b01-8394-44eb88b5282d.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026vThNPkRZ201785315083.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7a1aed1b-cf59-4b01-8394-44eb88b5282d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><strong>必試美食：海女食堂歎甘香鮑魚粥</strong></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>來到牛島，絕對不能錯過由海女開設的食堂。海女不配戴氧氣筒徒手潛入海底採集海產，保證食材新鮮。海女食堂的鮑魚粥及海螺青口刀削麵，均規定必須點「二人份」起，結伴同遊的旅客需留意。</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"16128a5c-02c4-4505-bfee-9d8f8fe5c347.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026RImungahfK1785315083.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"16128a5c-02c4-4505-bfee-9d8f8fe5c347.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"118372c2-ec77-47be-b66d-85ae401d4f90.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026vMGVteWP2Z1785315082.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"118372c2-ec77-47be-b66d-85ae401d4f90.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><strong>必買手信：100%純天然新鮮花生醬</strong></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>牛島土壤肥沃，盛產皮薄鮮甜、堅果味濃郁的花生。當地的花生醬標榜100%僅用花生粒製成，零糖、零油且無防腐劑，帶有獨特烘炒香氣而不油膩。最特別的是產品均為「當天新鮮製造」，保質期為六個月，店內更售賣各式海女相關手信。</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style='padding-inline-start: 32px; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><li style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"cd6692c6-d32b-400a-88ff-edc7a10b2d72.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026RRwwPcCSNy1785315082.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"cd6692c6-d32b-400a-88ff-edc7a10b2d72.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-04T13:09:08.539289+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":962,"images":11,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}